#
# Re-establishes the imported targets that the exported ImaginaryMOSTargets set
# references, before that target set is loaded. Generated by IMOSPackaging at
# configure time; the branch below reflects how *this* install was built:
#
#   * Vendored deps (default): the pinned libxml2/zlib/IXWebSocket objects are
#     folded into the installed static archives (fat-archive) and absorbed into
#     the shared libraries, so only their *system* transitive libraries have to
#     be resolved on the consumer side (threads, and OpenSSL when TLS is on).
#   * System deps (IMOS_USE_SYSTEM_DEPS): the vendored libraries were not built;
#     the export references the system LibXml2/ZLIB/ixwebsocket packages, which
#     are resolved here.
#
# @IMOS_DEP_MODE_COMMENT@

include(CMakeFindDependencyMacro)

@IMOS_FIND_DEPENDENCY_CALLS@
